{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011Cd51sVNecgwD21jLBVLJG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```dafny\n// CSD_RATIONALE_BEGIN\n// Strategy for gsm_symbolic with Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B, maxSteps=900, stepTokenBudget=1.\n// We delegate the full decode loop to GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan, which\n// handles free-text reasoning outside constrained spans and parser-controlled\n// generation inside them.  A prefixBudget of maxSteps/2 allows up to half the\n// total budget for unconstrained chain-of-thought before the helper forces entry\n// into a constrained span for the structured answer.  When maxSteps == 0 we\n// return immediately with initialised defaults so all postconditions hold\n// trivially without any LM calls.\n// CSD_RATIONALE_END\n\n// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN\n// 1. parser_validity:\n//    GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan's postcondition directly guarantees\n//    !insideConstrainedOut ==> currentConstrainedOut == [] and\n//    insideConstrainedOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut).\n//    These are preserved because every internal ManagedStep call maintains the\n//    same invariant: OpenConstrainedSpan resets currentOut to [] (valid empty\n//    prefix by parser.IsValidPrefix([]) from the method precondition), and each\n//    ConstrainedStep appends only parser-valid tokens so IsValidPrefix stays true.\n//\n// 2. progress (|generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps):\n//    GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan runs at most maxSteps iterations of\n//    ManagedStep, each costing exactly +1 token-step regardless of path.\n//    Every step grows |generated| by at most 1 visible token (EOS is not\n//    appended; forced delimiters each count as one step and add one token),\n//    so |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps is preserved end-to-end.\n//    We set cost := maxSteps when maxSteps > 0, satisfying cost <= maxSteps and\n//    cost > 0, which discharges the final disjunctive postcondition.\n// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END\n\ngenerated := generatedPrefix;\ninsideConstrainedOut := insideConstrained;\ncurrentConstrainedOut := currentConstrained;\ncost := 0;\n\nif maxSteps == 0 {\n  // cost == 0 <= 0 == maxSteps; all other postconditions hold from initialisation.\n} else {\n  var prefixBudget: nat := maxSteps / 2;\n  var g, i, c := helpers.GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan(\n    lm, parser, prompt, generatedPrefix, insideConstrained, currentConstrained,\n    maxSteps, prefixBudget, validTokenGroups, 2.0, 3, eosToken);\n  generated := g;\n  insideConstrainedOut := i;\n  currentConstrainedOut := c;\n  cost := maxSteps;\n}\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10037,"cache_read_input_tokens":1145,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10037},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5349a578-09bb-4b3d-a598-b64217465637","uuid":"23ca6d43-bcd1-4d34-8237-8b8d106067da","request_id":"req_011Cd51sUGgBPyXMGzurcNxq"}
